1
00:00:16,076 --> 00:00:19,810
Tracks in the mud and a scent on the wind

2
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:24,154
The beast at my side is my brother, my kin

3
00:00:24,204 --> 00:00:27,758
Eagle eye open, I see what you hide

4
00:00:27,808 --> 00:00:32,062
No shadow is deep when the wild is my guide

5
00:00:32,112 --> 00:00:36,087
Mark the prey, call the pack

6
00:00:36,137 --> 00:00:40,051
Nothing runs that won't come back

7
00:00:40,101 --> 00:00:44,135
Run with the wild, howl at the moon

8
00:00:44,185 --> 00:00:48,039
Aimed shot singing, your end comes soon

9
00:00:48,089 --> 00:00:52,023
Bound to the beast, bound to the bow

10
00:00:52,073 --> 00:00:56,256
Where the wolves run, there I go

11
00:01:00,041 --> 00:01:04,015
Frost trap closing, the serpent's sting

12
00:01:04,065 --> 00:01:07,979
Feign my death, then the arrows sing

13
00:01:08,029 --> 00:01:11,763
Scatter the hunters who thought they were wise

14
00:01:11,813 --> 00:01:16,047
My pet at your throat as the last daylight dies

15
00:01:16,097 --> 00:01:20,051
Mark the prey, call the pack

16
