21
00:01:50,091 --> 00:01:53,173
Quiet in the high grass

22
00:01:54,075 --> 00:01:56,557
Breathing with the land

23
00:01:58,219 --> 00:02:00,350
Every life I take

24
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:04,525
I take with open hand

25
00:02:07,088 --> 00:02:09,490
Bestial wrath!

26
